{"signature": "08f5898c9bde6fd6406f9ab4aa6f1e27853aa26b60ec9240d4c17eeed27b7470", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "linear", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/issues", "field": "identifier", "values": ["ART-577", "ENG-1385", "ENG-1834", "ENG-1874", "ENG-1892", "ENG-1972", "ENG-2021", "ENG-2065", "ENG-2136", "ENG-2215", "ENG-2216", "ENG-2217", "ENG-2275", "ENG-2277", "ENG-2298", "ENG-2323", "ENG-2331", "ENG-2349", "ENG-2377", "ENG-2400", "ENG-2402", "ENG-2404", "ENG-2424", "ENG-645"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/385", "field": "identifier", "value": "ART-577", "record": {"id": "ART-577", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ART", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_7fe31e7ec8199618", "creator_id": "usr_Victor Barnes", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ART-577", "number": 577, "title": "3D Modeling Needs for Mini Games 3 (Tile dozer)", "description": "This is the master ticket that keeps track of the various task for 3D modeling ([PERSON_NAME_0040])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-29T16:56:19Z", "completed_at": "2024-09-09T10:29:59Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 752224, "labels": ["Sprint 19 - June 14th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-13T16:08:33Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-09T10:29:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1240", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1385", "record": {"id": "ENG-1385", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1385", "number": 1385, "title": "Implement Win & Collect Live Ops Event", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0092] & Samuel & Douglas\n\nThis feature is very similar to quests.\n\n* Integrate accessibility into UI.\n* Showing progress on button icon\n* Reward flow implementation using \u201cchest open\u201d VFX\n\nBack end work done by Douglas's team.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-09-16T16:49:27Z", "completed_at": "2024-10-03T13:59:08Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 717455, "labels": ["Baklava Hot Fix"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-09-11T18:29:02Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-03T13:59:08Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1725", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1834", "record": {"id": "ENG-1834", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1812", "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1834", "number": 1834, "title": "Collect & Win Event Issue List", "description": "Version or date: ios 281\n\n 1. ~~Clicking \u201clet\u2019s go\u201d button on magical wings doesn\u2019t close the pop-up (the first pop up shown automatically)~~\n\n    [RPReplay_Final1730527781.MP4]([URL_51572])\n 2. ~~If the first event level is not completed, the event is popping up every time saga map visited.~~\n    1. ~~The first event pop up has no target showing collect 0 tokens and 0/0.~~\n\n       [ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5847]_1 (1).MOV]([URL_51545])\n 3. There is no pop up if the event is unlocked after ch3 lvl5. ~~This event is unlocked later on because it's not turned on for that week so I couldn't see any event pop up at where it should be.~~ \n    1. ~~Therefore, the events are unlocked in level so it creates a problem in the first 2 rewards based on syncing issues.~~\n\n       [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.44.30_b4bf090b.mp4]([URL_51571])\n\n       [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.43.38_b15c1be6.mp4]([URL_51570])\n 4. ~~The rewards are above the inventory.~~\n\n    ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5871]-04_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_51569])\n 5. If there is a surplus token after completing a milestone, there is no additional vfx to show the next progression bar. \n\n    [RPReplay_Final1730476574.MP4]([URL_51544])\n 6. ~~In live ops, instead of Infinite rewind icon, it\u2019s showing regular rewind icon on reward screen.~~ \n\n    ![WhatsApp Image 2024-11-04 at 19.47.55_ad15dd3e.jpg]([URL_51568])\n 7. If the page is changed while getting an event reward, the circular progress bar stays as complete but the pop up progress is in the next reward milestone.  \n\n    [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.45.01_45205e02.mp4]([URL_51567])\n\n    [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.45.57_fb1732f8.mp4]([URL_51566])\n 8. If the scene is changed before getting event rewards, the rewards are suspended. The reward screen and animation is triggered after new tokens earned through levels. \n\n    [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.47.09_dd71f700.mp4]([URL_51565])\n    1. After getting new event milestone and starting a new session, the bar shows 7/7 but instead it's like 2/7. \n       1. If I change the scene, it corrects itself as 1/7\n\n          [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.47.29_b9de7a56.mp4]([URL_51564])\n 9. Should say \"Collect Ladybug Tokens by Beating Levels and Win Amazing Rewards!\"\n\n    ![image.png]([URL_51563])\n10. ~~If level is failed, the vfx is still triggered and tokens are floating to the progress bar.~~ \n\n[RPReplay_Final1733141438.MP4]([URL_51562])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-12-04T17:37:59Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-23T12:25:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 600909, "labels": ["Nova Release", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:46:02Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-23T12:25:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1769", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1874", "record": {"id": "ENG-1874", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_EMPLOYEE_0032", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1874", "number": 1874, "title": "Leaderboards System", "description": "Kick off complete\n\nDoc here: [[URL_51622])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": "2024-12-06", "started_at": "2024-11-27T16:32:17Z", "completed_at": "2024-12-23T12:26:03Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 600908, "labels": ["Sprint 27 Nova - Dec 6th", "Nova Release"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-13T02:44:14Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-23T12:26:03Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1789", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1892", "record": {"id": "ENG-1892", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1892", "number": 1892, "title": "The quests are not populated at all in both platforms", "description": "Version or date: android 489\n\n### Description: \n\nThe issue is once the quests are unlocked, there is no quest in both tabs. \n\n### Visual References: \n\n[1000001167.mp4]([URL_51644])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-11-18T17:44:37Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 650990, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-15T17:42:53Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-18T17:44:37Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1878", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-1972", "record": {"id": "ENG-1972", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1972", "number": 1972, "title": "Simple Dashboard For Compensation", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-05-05T19:27:38Z", "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:44Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 408967, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-12-02T18:58:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T19:27:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1933", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2021", "record": {"id": "ENG-2021", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1834", "assignee_id": "usr_caafeec2804b3a67", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2021", "number": 2021, "title": "Remaining Collect & Win Issues", "description": "Version or date: android 922\n\n### Description: \n\n* If there is a surplus token after completing a milestone, there is no additional vfx to show the next progression bar.\n\n[RPReplay_Final1730476574.MP4]([URL_51544])\n\n* If the page is changed while getting an event reward, the circular progress bar stays as complete but the pop up progress is in the next reward milestone.  \n\n  [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.45.01_45205e02.mp4]([URL_51567])\n\n  [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.45.57_fb1732f8.mp4]([URL_51566])\n* If the scene is changed before getting event rewards, the rewards are suspended. The reward screen and animation is triggered after new tokens earned through levels. \n\n  [WhatsApp Video 2024-11-04 at 19.47.09_dd71f700.mp4]([URL_51565])\n\n\n* Should say \"Collect Ladybug Tokens by Beating Levels and Win Amazing Rewards!\"\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51563])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-03T15:37:08Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-23T16:15:34Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 556039, "labels": ["Bug", "Sprint 29 Avengers -  January 31st"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-12-23T12:25:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-23T16:15:34Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1980", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2065", "record": {"id": "ENG-2065", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2065", "number": 2065, "title": "River Rush - Fastest Completion Event", "description": "The spec is ready for the mine rush. \n\n[\\[Live Ops\\] River Rush - Fastest Completion]([URL_51978])\n\nHere is the game references and wireframes. \n\n[Fastest Completion Event]([URL_51977])\n\n![River Rush.png]([URL_51976])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-02-13T22:09:18Z", "completed_at": "2025-03-18T16:27:17Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-19T02:27:08Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 478267, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-01-16T18:57:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-18T16:27:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2057", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2136", "record": {"id": "ENG-2136", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2136", "number": 2136, "title": "Season Pass", "description": "Document: [[URL_52060])\nFigma: \n[[URL_52059])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-05-05T09:41:45Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-06T04:09:46Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 409553, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-02-10T11:06:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T09:41:45Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2143", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2215", "record": {"id": "ENG-2215", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2215", "number": 2215, "title": "Test Plan to Optimize the Base Pity Mechanic", "description": "### **Test Plan to Optimize the Base Pity Mechanic**\n\nSince we're establishing a **baseline with no pity mechanic**, we'll first analyze **win rates without any pity adjustments** and then optimize the **base pity mechanic**.\n\n## **1. Test Conditions**\n\nWe will run simulations for **Chapter 5, Levels 1-15**, under different **pity mechanic configurations**.\n\n### **Baseline Condition (No Pity Mechanic)**\n\n* **Goal:** Establish the **raw win rate** without any pity influence.\n* **Test Runs:** **7,500 bot plays (500 per level)**.\n* **Other Constants:**\n  * **Character:** Sophie (Level 10)\n  * **No adjustments** to **unique symbols, chops, or starting hand tiles**.\n  * **No win streaks, no pre-level boosters**.\n\n#### **Metrics to Record:**\n\n* **Attempts**\n* **Losses**\n* **Avg Win Rate**\n* **Avg Handtiles Left When Won**\n* **How Many Board Tiles Left When Lost**\n* **# of Tiles on the Board at Start**\n* **# of Tiles on the Starting Draw Pile**\n* **Avg Additional Tiles to finish the level when lost**\n\n### **Test Variations for Base Pity Mechanic**\n\nOnce the baseline is set, we will optimize these **base pity mechanic parameters**:\n\n```\n{0.0f, 0.1f, 0.16f, 0.26f, 0.41f, 0.66f, 1.0f}\n```\n\n* **Goal:** Determine the best sequence of pity activations.\n* **Variations:** Adjust **each probability in the range** to fine-tune the balance.\n\n#### **Test Cases**\n\nEach bot will:\n\n1. **Play without a pity mechanic (baseline test).**\n2. **Play with different base pity mechanic variations.**\n3. **Log key win/loss metrics.**\n\n---\n\n## **2. Optimization Strategy**\n\nOnce data is collected:\n\n1. **Compare baseline win rates to pity-adjusted win rates.**\n2. **Use Bayesian Optimization** to find the best pity mechanic activation sequence.\n3. \\*\\*Validate the final settings in a second simulation batch.\n\n---\n\n## **3. Running Bayesian Optimization to Determine Optimal Pity Mechanic Parameters**\n\nSince **Bayesian Optimization (BO)** is well-suited for optimizing **multi-variable functions** with expensive evaluations (such as bot simulations), we will use it to **find the best pity mechanic parameters** for *Domino Delights*.\n\n### **1. Problem Setup**\n\nWe need to **find the optimal pity mechanic settings** that:\n\n\u2705 Keep the **win rate in the target range (based on the level's base win rate)**.\n\n\u2705 Ensure a **near-miss experience** by adjusting **pity activation probabilities**.\n\n### **Parameters to Optimize**\n\nBayesian Optimization will **fine-tune the pity probabilities**:\n\n| **Pull Number** | **Current Pity Activation (Baseline)** | **Optimization Range** |\n| -- | -- | -- |\n| **1st** | 0.0f | Fixed (No pity on first pull) |\n| **2nd** | 0.1f | `[0.05 - 0.2]` |\n| **3rd** | 0.16f | `[0.1 - 0.3]` |\n| **4th** | 0.26f | `[0.15 - 0.4]` |\n| **5th** | 0.41f | `[0.25 - 0.55]` |\n| **6th** | 0.66f | `[0.5 - 0.85]` |\n| **7th** | 1.0f | Fixed (Always guarantees a match) |\n\nWe use **Bayesian Optimization** to efficiently explore these **parameters** and find the best configuration.\n\n### **2. Bayesian Optimization Approach**\n\nBayesian Optimization will:\n\n1. **Select an initial set of pity mechanic settings** and simulate win rates.\n2. **Use Gaussian Processes (GPs)** to predict the best parameters for the next simulation.\n3. **Iteratively refine the parameters** to find the optimal pity settings.\n\n#### **Objective Function**\n\nThe **objective function minimizes the absolute difference** from the **target win rate per level**:\n\ntotal_loss = \\\\sum |Simulated Win Rate - Base Win Rate of Level| / 15\n\nLower values are better.\n\n---\n\n## **4. Implementing Bayesian Optimization in Python**\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport skopt\nfrom skopt import gp_minimize\nfrom skopt.space import Real\nfrom skopt.utils import use_named_args\nimport pandas as pd\nimport random\n# Define the optimization space for pity probabilities\nparam_space = [\n    Real(0.05, 0.2, name=\"pity_2\"),   # Pity for 2nd draw\n    Real(0.1, 0.3, name=\"pity_3\"),    # Pity for 3rd draw\n    Real(0.15, 0.4, name=\"pity_4\"),   # Pity for 4th draw\n    Real(0.25, 0.55, name=\"pity_5\"),  # Pity for 5th draw\n    Real(0.5, 0.85, name=\"pity_6\")    # Pity for 6th draw\n]\n# Fixed values for 1st and 7th draws\nFIXED_PITY_VALUES = [0.0, 1.0]\n# Simulated bot play function\ndef simulate_pity_mechanic(pity_rates, num_simulations=500):\n    win_count = 0\n    for _ in range(num_simulations):\n        pulls = 0\n        while pulls < 7:\n            if random.random() < pity_rates[pulls]:\n                win_count += 1\n                break\n            pulls += 1\n    return win_count / num_simulations  # Return win rate percentage\n# Load base win rates per level (assumed calculated separately)\nbase_win_rates = {level: random.uniform(40, 60) for level in range(1, 16)}  # Simulated base win rates\n@use_named_args(param_space)\ndef objective(**params):\n    pity_rates = [FIXED_PITY_VALUES[0]] + [params[f\"pity_{i}\"] for i in range(2, 7)] + [FIXED_PITY_VALUES[1]]\n    total_loss = 0\n    for level in range(1, 16):\n        win_rate = simulate_pity_mechanic(pity_rates)\n        target_win_rate = base_win_rates[level]\n        total_loss += abs(win_rate * 100 - target_win_rate)\n    return total_loss / 15\nresult = gp_minimize(objective, param_space, n_calls=20, random_state=42)\nbest_pity_values = [FIXED_PITY_VALUES[0]] + result.x + [FIXED_PITY_VALUES[1]]\nimport ace_tools as tools\noptimized_results = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"Pull Number\": list(range(1, 8)),\n    \"Optimized Pity Probability\": best_pity_values\n})\ntools.display_dataframe_to_user(name=\"Optimized Pity Mechanic Parameters\", dataframe=optimized_results)\n```", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-03-15T18:19:38Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-16T02:22:21Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 482475, "labels": ["Levels", "Cappadocia", "Bot", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-03-06T04:17:20Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-15T18:19:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2144", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2216", "record": {"id": "ENG-2216", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2216", "number": 2216, "title": "Run Bayesian Optimization to Determine Adaptive Pity Parameters", "description": "Now that we have the **baseline pity parameters**, the next step is to **optimize adaptive pity mechanics** using **Bayesian Optimization**.\n\n---\n\n## **1. Objective: Fine-Tune Adaptive Pity Mechanics**\n\nAdaptive pity mechanics **adjust dynamically** based on:\n\n* **Hand tiles left**\n* **Board tiles left**\n* **Retry count average**\n\nWe aim to **find the best adaptive pity adjustments** that: \u2705 Ensure a **near-miss experience**\n\u2705 Keep the **win rate close to target**\n\u2705 Prevent **overcompensation**\n\n---\n\n## **2. Parameters to Optimize**\n\nWe will fine-tune the **adaptive pity rule adjustments**:\n\n| **Adaptive Pity Type** | **Current Adjustment** | **Optimization Range** |\n| -- | -- | -- |\n| **Hand Tiles Left (\u22643)** | `+0.3f` | `[0.2 - 0.5]` |\n| **Hand Tiles Left (3-6)** | `+0.2f` | `[0.1 - 0.3]` |\n| **Hand Tiles Left (6-10)** | `-1 (no effect)` | `[0.0 - 0.1]` |\n| **Board Tiles Left (\u22656)** | `+0.2f` | `[0.1 - 0.4]` |\n| **Board Tiles Left (3-5)** | `+0.1f` | `[0.05 - 0.2]` |\n| **Retry Count Average (\u22651.75)** | `+0.25f` | `[0.15 - 0.4]` |\n| **Retry Count Average (1.5-1.74)** | `+0.15f` | `[0.1 - 0.3]` |\n| **Retry Count Average (1.25-1.49)** | `+0.05f` | `[0.01 - 0.1]` |\n\n---\n\n## **3. Bayesian Optimization Approach**\n\nBayesian Optimization will:\n\n1. **Select an initial set of adaptive pity adjustments**.\n2. **Simulate win rates across levels**.\n3. **Use Gaussian Processes (GPs)** to predict the best parameters.\n4. **Refine the values iteratively**.\n\n### **Objective Function**\n\nLoss=\u2211level\u2223Simulated\u00a0Win\u00a0Rate\u2212Target\u00a0Win\u00a0Rate\u2223\\\\text{Loss} = \\\\sum\\_{level} | \\\\text{Simulated Win Rate} - \\\\text{Target Win Rate} |Loss=level\u2211\u2223Simulated\u00a0Win\u00a0Rate\u2212Target\u00a0Win\u00a0Rate\u2223\n\nLower values are better.\n\n---\n\n## **4. Implementing Bayesian Optimization in Python**\n\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport skopt\nfrom skopt import gp_minimize\nfrom skopt.space import Real\nfrom skopt.utils import use_named_args\nimport pandas as pd\nimport random\n\n# Define the optimization space for adaptive pity mechanics\nparam_space = [\n    Real(0.2, 0.5, name=\"hand_tiles_3\"),   # Hand tiles \u22643\n    Real(0.1, 0.3, name=\"hand_tiles_6\"),   # Hand tiles 3-6\n    Real(0.0, 0.1, name=\"hand_tiles_10\"),  # Hand tiles 6-10\n    Real(0.1, 0.4, name=\"board_tiles_6\"),  # Board tiles \u22656\n    Real(0.05, 0.2, name=\"board_tiles_3\"), # Board tiles 3-5\n    Real(0.15, 0.4, name=\"retry_1.75\"),    # Retry count \u22651.75\n    Real(0.1, 0.3, name=\"retry_1.5\"),      # Retry count 1.5-1.74\n    Real(0.01, 0.1, name=\"retry_1.25\")     # Retry count 1.25-1.49\n]\n\n# Load base win rates per level (from previous simulation)\nbase_win_rates = {level: random.uniform(40, 60) for level in range(1, 16)}  # Simulated base win rates\n\n# Simulated bot play function\ndef simulate_adaptive_pity(pity_adjustments, num_simulations=500):\n    win_count = 0\n    for _ in range(num_simulations):\n        hand_tiles = random.randint(0, 10)\n        board_tiles = random.randint(1, 20)\n        retries = random.uniform(1.0, 2.0)\n        \n        pity_bonus = 0.0\n        if hand_tiles <= 3:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"hand_tiles_3\"]\n        elif hand_tiles <= 6:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"hand_tiles_6\"]\n        elif hand_tiles <= 10:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"hand_tiles_10\"]\n\n        if board_tiles >= 6:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"board_tiles_6\"]\n        elif board_tiles >= 3:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"board_tiles_3\"]\n\n        if retries >= 1.75:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"retry_1.75\"]\n        elif retries >= 1.5:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"retry_1.5\"]\n        elif retries >= 1.25:\n            pity_bonus += pity_adjustments[\"retry_1.25\"]\n\n        win_probability = min(0.6 + pity_bonus, 1.0)  # Ensuring the cap\n        if random.random() < win_probability:\n            win_count += 1\n\n    return win_count / num_simulations  # Return win rate percentage\n\n@use_named_args(param_space)\ndef objective(**params):\n    total_loss = 0\n    for level in range(1, 16):  # Optimize for first 15 levels\n        win_rate = simulate_adaptive_pity(params)\n        target_win_rate = base_win_rates[level]\n        total_loss += abs(win_rate * 100 - target_win_rate)\n\n    return total_loss / 15  # Average loss across levels\n\n# Run Bayesian Optimization\nresult = gp_minimize(objective, param_space, n_calls=20, random_state=42)\n\n# Best found parameters\nbest_adaptive_pity_values = {param_space[i].name: result.x[i] for i in range(len(param_space))}\n\nimport ace_tools as tools\n# Store optimized adaptive pity mechanic settings\noptimized_adaptive_results = pd.DataFrame(best_adaptive_pity_values.items(), columns=[\"Adaptive Pity Parameter\", \"Optimized Value\"])\ntools.display_dataframe_to_user(name=\"Optimized Adaptive Pity Mechanic Parameters\", dataframe=optimized_adaptive_results)\n```", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-03-15T18:19:29Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-09-16T02:22:21Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 482475, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-03-06T04:35:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-15T18:19:29Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2145", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2217", "record": {"id": "ENG-2217", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2217", "number": 2217, "title": "Optimize Pre-Level Parameters for Target Win Rates using Bayesian Optimization", "description": "**Objective:** To determine the optimal pre-level parameters that achieve specific target win rates of **90%, 75%, 60%, 45%, and 30%** with a **5% margin of error** using Bayesian Optimization.\n\n---\n\n**Scope:** This optimization process will fine-tune the following pre-level parameters:\n\n1. **Win Streak Adjustments** (Chops-based bonuses for consecutive wins):\n   * Win Streak 1 \u2192 +1 Chop\n   * Win Streak 2 \u2192 +2 Chops\n   * Win Streak 3 \u2192 +3 Chops\n2. **Pre-Level Booster Adjustments**:\n   * Extra Tile \u2192 +1 Chop\n   * Extra Wild Tile \u2192 +2 Chops\n3. **Player Bucketing Adjustments** (Hand tile reductions based on average attempts to win):\n   * Top Bucket (1.00 - 1.25 avg attempts) \u2192 3 hand tile reduction\n   * Second Bucket (1.25 - 1.50 avg attempts) \u2192 2 hand tile reduction\n   * Third Bucket (1.50 - 1.75 avg attempts) \u2192 1 hand tile reduction\n   * Bottom Bucket (1.75 - 10 avg attempts) \u2192 No hand tile reduction\n   * **Minimum hand tile count set to 5**\n4. **Character Level Scaling**:\n   * Level 0-20 \u2192 0 Chops\n   * Level 20-39 \u2192 +1 Chop\n   * Level 39+ \u2192 +2 Chops\n5. **Retry-Based Adjustments (Unique Symbol Count Reductions)**:\n   * If win rate over last **3 games is 0%** \u2192 Reduce unique symbol count by 1\n   * If win rate over last **6 games is 0%** \u2192 Reduce unique symbol count by 2\n\n---\n\n**Approach:**\n\n1. **Simulate bot plays for each pre-level configuration** using a Bayesian Optimization approach.\n2. **Compare win rates** against target win rates for **90%, 75%, 60%, 45%, and 30%**.\n3. **Adjust pre-level parameters iteratively** to minimize deviation from target win rates.\n4. **Optimize pre-level settings** by running multiple Bayesian Optimization iterations, fine-tuning variables to stabilize win rates within the acceptable range.\n\n---\n\n**Implementation Plan:**\n\n* **Step 1:** Run **baseline bot simulations** with existing pre-level parameters.\n* **Step 2:** Implement **Bayesian Optimization** to identify the best pre-level parameter values.\n* **Step 3:** Validate the optimized values across **multiple simulations** to ensure consistency.\n* **Step 4:** Finalize the pre-level parameter settings and deploy for live A/B testing.\n\n---\n\n**Expected Outcome:** \u2705 Identifies the best pre-level parameters to achieve **balanced difficulty across all target win rates**.\n\u2705 Uses **Bayesian Optimization** to efficiently fine-tune settings without brute-force testing.\n\u2705 Ensures a **smooth player experience** with **gradual difficulty adjustments based on performance**.\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps:**\n\n* Run the Bayesian Optimization script on **pre-level parameters**.\n* Evaluate the results and make adjustments as needed.\n* Conduct A/B tests to validate real player impact.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-03-15T18:20:12Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-04T20:00:04Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-11-05T04:09:25Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 410374, "labels": ["Cappadocia", "Sprint 30 Cappadocia -  Feb 28th"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-03-06T04:48:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-04T20:00:05Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2208", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2275", "record": {"id": "ENG-2275", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2275", "number": 2275, "title": "Dashboard for players' compentsation", "description": "What we need as something a dashboard where we can manipulate what is stored on the players' profile. \n\nAt first we should be able to detect any given player from the user-id. We need a search bar for user-ids. \n\nWe should be able to add/remove the currencies for those players. \n\nMark/unmark any tutorial that player has on their FTUE.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 445180, "labels": ["Server/Cloud", "Pupusa"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-10T15:53:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-05T18:33:15Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2210", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2277", "record": {"id": "ENG-2277", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Bugs", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2277", "number": 2277, "title": "Lives economy is buggy and can go minus values.", "description": "Version or date: ios submission 141\n\n### Description: \n\nThere is a lives bug. I ran out of lives while playing the level and have seen the out of lives screen. When I quit that screen and went back to saga map I had one life with 15 mins time for the next one. This can\u2019t be true so there is a bug\n\n[[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6138].9271485.mp4]([URL_52284])\n\nSimilar experience is done to me as well \n\n* 8:10 4, -1\n* 8:10 3, -1\n* 8:10 2, -1\n* 8:10 1, -1\n* 8:10 0, -1\n* 8:10 1, +1\n* 8:52 2, +1\n* 9:01 1, -1\n* 9:01 0, -1\n* 9:13 1, +1\n* 9:19 0, -1\n* 9:45 1, +1\n* 10:27 1, 0\n* 11:05 3, +2\n* 11:06 2, -1\n* 11:08 1, -1\n* 11:09 0, -1\n* 11:10 1, +1 \n\nHere is the list of lives related action I had after getting 2 lives at 11:05, it's impossible to get another lives at 11:10 but it happens somehow. \n\nAnother thing is that it might be related to being homed out during playing. Here is another player who got -2 lives even though he had 1 life in just 1 min before. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52283])\n\nI still couldn't repro the issue, it might be related to the time compensation happens. Because at the same time players balance go up to 10k coins. \n\n##", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 443712, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-11T16:21:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T13:51:55Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2233", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2298", "record": {"id": "ENG-2298", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2298", "number": 2298, "title": "Ladybug Harvest (3-day win&collect event) gives 15m infinite lives after every level completion", "description": "Version or date: ios 141 submission\n\n### Description: \n\nThe friday-to-sunday win & collect event lasting 3 days is broken because it always reset to the first stage and after every level completed, it gives 15-min infinite lives over and over again.\n\nIt doesn't happen on 2-day events, only present in the 3-day event. I don't know if it's completely backend or combination of both.  \n\n### Visual References:\n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6166]_1.MP4]([URL_52356])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to continue to next stage after completing the first stage just like other win&collect events. \n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Wait for friday\n2. Play a level\n3. Observe that 15-min infinite lives are granted\n4. Play another level\n5. Observe that stage is reset to 1 and 15-min infinite lives are granted", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-29T03:27:57Z", "completed_at": "2025-04-29T16:55:10Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 417759, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-21T10:53:20Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-29T16:55:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2262", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2323", "record": {"id": "ENG-2323", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2323", "number": 2323, "title": "Add Hero Offers to Shop", "description": "The game currently lacks hero-based offer in the shop because players are not buying pop up offers. So we need to have a hero offer in the shop by giving random hero tokens. \n\nStatic shop offer with different color variants. @Martin.Walsh \n\n**WIP**\n\n![image.png]([URL_52446])\n\nFor that, \n\n1. Implement Hero Offer items (the items except hero tokens)\n2. Implement random token drop chance (only with the unlocked heroes)\n3. After successful purchase, trigger the chest animation to show which hero tokens are granted. Something like tavern chest animation. \n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6215]_1.MP4]([URL_52445])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-07T17:50:06Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-13T17:03:17Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 397591, "labels": ["Hot Fix - Global Launch"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-01T13:43:47Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-13T17:03:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2271", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2331", "record": {"id": "ENG-2331", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Regression", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2331", "number": 2331, "title": "After win&collect is completed, the null reference creates buzzing sound.", "description": "Version or date: ios 1541\n\n### Description: \n\nWhen all win & collect tokens and rewards are collected, there is a null reference causing buzzing sound in every saga map return. \n\nIt doesn't cause any functional issue per se but it might be hindering some other processes. It's also annoying with the buzzing sound. \n\n![image.png]([URL_52477])\n\n[https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/ios:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/2d4aaa6812314875d883435a6d456376?versions=0.2.1541%20(1541)&time=last-thirty-days&types=crash&sessionEventKey=db79f1b27db24574b9b658c254036f74_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6233]](https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/ios:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/2d4aaa6812314875d883435a6d456376?versions=0.2.1541%20(1541)&time=last-thirty-days&types=crash&sessionEventKey=db79f1b27db24574b9b658c254036f74_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6233])\n\n### Visual References: \n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6232]_1.MP4]([URL_52476])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to not give null reference when the event is completed. \n\n### Steps to Repro: \n\n1. Get all win&collect rewards (complete the event)\n2. Start another level\n3. After returning to the saga map, there is a null reference causing buzzing sound. \n4. It happens also while refreshing the scene by changing chapters etc.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-29T17:11:27Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 147118, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-05T16:00:31Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-06T16:56:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2290", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2349", "record": {"id": "ENG-2349", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Bugs", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2349", "number": 2349, "title": "Axe arena and win and collect infinite lives timers are not correct.", "description": "Version or date: iOS_Submission_151, Dev_iOS_1606, Dev_Android_1879, Android_Submission_211\n\n### Description: \n\n* When Axe arena started, it gives 10 min of infinite lives but it should be 15 min.  \n\n[Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6243]_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.mp4]([URL_52529])\n\n* Win & collect infinite lives rewards should be updated with 10 min. Currently they are 15 min. Check the table and highlighted colors for  the reference. [[URL_52528])\n\n[Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6242]_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.mp4]([URL_52527])\n\n###", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 394807, "labels": ["Non-Reviewed Tickets", "DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-15T15:27:01Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T14:11:30Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2310", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2377", "record": {"id": "ENG-2377", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2377", "number": 2377, "title": "Telegram DD Master Ticket", "description": null, "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-24T19:49:40Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 161265, "labels": ["DD 2.1"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:32:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T14:19:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2337", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2400", "record": {"id": "ENG-2400", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Bugs", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2400", "number": 2400, "title": "Lives are not generating for some real players.", "description": "There is a live ticket about lives are not regenerated after a 10 day interval. Player lost all lives, killed the app, then returned 11 days later. The lives should be full but it still shows 0. \n\nHere is the player's log \n\n[[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6417].1465226.mp4]([URL_53000])\n\n The weird thing is, when he relogin, the iap packs couldn't populated and throwing some error logs into metabase. The day later, his lives are full.\n\nAnd this is the error that player got. \n\n[https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/android:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/38b6e0a4b7790c337b48f727eef2e552?time=7d&sessionEventKey=6906C[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6416]B226A32C83CF6_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6415]&sessionTab=data&userInfoQuery=[IDENTIFIER_26332]](https://console.firebase.google.com/project/domino-delights/crashlytics/app/android:com.harmonygames.dominodelights/issues/38b6e0a4b7790c337b48f727eef2e552?time=7d&sessionEventKey=6906C[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6416]B226A32C83CF6_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6415]&sessionTab=data&userInfoQuery=[IDENTIFIER_26332])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 148708, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:06:38Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-02T13:06:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2339", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2402", "record": {"id": "ENG-2402", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Bugs", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2402", "number": 2402, "title": "Win & collect rewards are not correct", "description": "Version or date: Dev_iOS_1773\n\n### Description: \n\nThe rewards are not the same as in the excel sheet. \n\n![image.png]([URL_53003])\n\nfor instance, the stage with 9 tokens, should give 5 star but it gives 15. \n\n![image.png]([URL_53002])\n\n### The rewards should be synced with the sheet below. \n\n[[URL_53001]) for 2-day events\n\n[[URL_52528]) for 3-day event.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 147114, "labels": ["DD 2.1", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:40:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-03T15:40:19Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2341", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2404", "record": {"id": "ENG-2404", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2401", "assignee_id": null, "creator_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2404", "number": 2404, "title": "Live-Ops UI Optimization", "description": "'- [ ] Collect&win\n- [X] Nate's treasure Hunt\n- [ ] Axe arena\n- [X] River Rush\n- [ ] Season Pass\n- [X] Remove Ad\n- [X] Offers\n- [ ] Rate-us pop-ups", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 146920, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:54:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-19T14:29:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2363", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2424", "record": {"id": "ENG-2424", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-2404", "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_fc22d5941b2aeb5c", "state_id": 